{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00571",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 15.14,
      "duration_seconds": 14.06,
      "text": "Mr Haldane, thanks for coming. I've got the letter from your GP here, saying you've had sore eyes since some welding. Have I got that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.19,
      "end_seconds": 23.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "That's about the size of it. Eye pain, mostly. Nothing dramatic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.5,
      "end_seconds": 30.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "So, eye pain since welding. Tell me how it started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.77,
      "end_seconds": 46.85,
      "duration_seconds": 14.08,
      "text": "I was welding most of the afternoon on Tuesday. Or it might have been Wednesday, they've run into one another. Anyway, that night it began to feel gritty and sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.93,
      "end_seconds": 60.34,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "So it came on that night, but you can't pin down whether it was Tuesday or Wednesday. That's fine, it isn't essential."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.66,
      "end_seconds": 65.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Sorry. I should have kept a note."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.78,
      "end_seconds": 77.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "No need to apologise. Were you wearing your helmet with the visor down the whole time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.68,
      "end_seconds": 90.6,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "Mostly. I lifted it for a minute or two to check a join. Probably longer than I'd care to admit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.45,
      "end_seconds": 99.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "Thank you, that's an honest answer. Does anything make the pain worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.83,
      "end_seconds": 108.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Bright lights bother me. I wore sunglasses indoors yesterday, and felt daft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.02,
      "end_seconds": 117.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Not daft, sensible. How would you rate the pain, mild, moderate, or worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.38,
      "end_seconds": 126.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Moderate. I can work through it, but I wouldn't want to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.55,
      "end_seconds": 135.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Understood. Any loss of vision, or things going blurry or dark in the middle?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.25,
      "end_seconds": 140.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "No, my sight's the same. Just sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.51,
      "end_seconds": 151.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "Good. So pain, bright lights make it worse, and your sight is unchanged. Do you wear glasses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.58,
      "end_seconds": 160.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Short-sighted, since I was a teenager. I've got my glasses in my pocket."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.47,
      "end_seconds": 167.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "And does any eye trouble run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.67,
      "end_seconds": 178.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "My mother had glaucoma. She lost a fair bit of her vision in the end."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.67,
      "end_seconds": 188.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that, and thank you, it's worth knowing. What's your job, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.0,
      "end_seconds": 197.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "I'm a welder at a boatyard. Twenty-two years now, so I should know better."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.85,
      "end_seconds": 211.07,
      "duration_seconds": 11.22,
      "text": "Twenty-two years, so you know the risks well. Before I look at the eyes properly, any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.62,
      "end_seconds": 226.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.75,
      "text": "Yes, actually. I'm allergic to some kind of eye drops. I come up in a reaction, but I can't recall what it was. Years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.26,
      "end_seconds": 240.76,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "So an allergy to certain eye drops, reaction not remembered. I'll note that, and we'll steer clear of any drops until we know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.97,
      "end_seconds": 246.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Fine. Is the examination going to hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.71,
      "end_seconds": 257.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.97,
      "text": "I'll keep it gentle. First the checks we do for everyone. Pressure, pulse, temperature and oxygen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.66,
      "end_seconds": 285.41,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Blood pressure is 132 over 84, pulse 70, temperature 36.7 degrees, and oxygen 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.33,
      "end_seconds": 290.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Sounds fine to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.59,
      "end_seconds": 303.0,
      "duration_seconds": 10.41,
      "text": "It is. Now chin on the rest please, and look straight at the light. A bit of glare, I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.7,
      "end_seconds": 308.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Ow. That's bright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.64,
      "end_seconds": 340.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "Both eyes look red, and the surface of both looks roughened, like a freshly sanded table top."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.06,
      "end_seconds": 345.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Is that bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.9,
      "end_seconds": 363.32,
      "duration_seconds": 15.42,
      "text": "It's what I'd expect. A welder who lifted his visor, red eyes, a rough surface. That looks most like a flash burn, what we call arc eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.24,
      "end_seconds": 373.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "And does that settle by itself? I was expecting drops or something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.93,
      "end_seconds": 386.55,
      "duration_seconds": 11.62,
      "text": "It usually does, so no drops this time. I'm not prescribing anything. Cool damp cloth over closed eyes, rest, and sunglasses outdoors."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.26,
      "end_seconds": 393.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "How long before I'm back at the boatyard?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.13,
      "end_seconds": 403.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "Two or three days off, and no welding at all until I've seen the eyes again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 405.59,
      "end_seconds": 410.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Right. That's awkward but doable. Could I drive home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.2,
      "end_seconds": 424.56,
      "duration_seconds": 12.36,
      "text": "In your sunglasses, yes, but get a lift if someone can come. Do you want a note for your foreman?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.81,
      "end_seconds": 430.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Please. He likes things on paper."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 432.56,
      "end_seconds": 443.09,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "I'll write that today. I'd also like to see you again in three days, to check the surface has healed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.37,
      "end_seconds": 450.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Three days. I'll ring the boatyard and tell them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.28,
      "end_seconds": 459.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Good. And please, always visor down, even for a quick glance at a join."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 460.26,
      "end_seconds": 463.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Fair point. Old habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 465.05,
      "end_seconds": 477.09,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "So to recap: rest, a cool cloth, sunglasses, and back here in three days. Ring the clinic if the pain gets sharply worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 478.93,
      "end_seconds": 481.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Will do. Thanks, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 484.65,
      "end_seconds": 488.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Take care of those eyes, Mr Haldane."
    }
  ]
}
